<!DOCTYPE html>
<html class="light" lang="en">
  <head>
    <%- include('../partials/head') %>
  </head>
  <body class="min-h-screen bg-surface-bright text-on-surface hf-dashboard">
    <% const applicationsUser = typeof currentUser === 'object' && currentUser ? currentUser : {}; %>
    <% const displayName = applicationsUser.fullName || 'Renter'; %>
    <%- include('../partials/sidebar-renter') %>

    <header class="sticky top-0 z-40 flex min-h-16 items-center justify-between border-b border-outline-variant bg-surface px-4 shadow-sm md:pl-[264px] md:pr-8">
      <div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate text-label-sm font-bold text-secondary">Renter workspace</p><p class="truncate text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"><%= displayName %></p></div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2">
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/notification-bell" aria-label="Notifications" title="Notifications"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/messages" aria-label="Messages" title="Messages"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">chat_bubble</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/settings" aria-label="Settings" title="Settings"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span></a>
        <a class="inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-lg text-on-surface-variant hover:bg-surface-container-low" href="/user/renter/profile" aria-label="Renter profile" title="Renter profile"><span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">person</span></a>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main class="w-full px-4 py-6 md:ml-[240px] md:w-[calc(100%-240px)] md:px-8 md:py-8 hf-dashboard-main">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl">
        <div class="mb-8"><p class="mb-1 text-label-md font-bold text-secondary">Renter workspace</p><h1 class="text-headline-lg font-bold text-primary">Applications</h1><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-md text-on-surface-variant">A housing application needs an authoritative listing, an intentional consented submission, and a complete status history.</p></div>

        <section class="mb-8 border-y border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-6 sm:px-6" aria-labelledby="renter-applications-status-title">
          <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4"><span class="material-symbols-outlined flex h-12 w-12 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg bg-primary text-on-primary" aria-hidden="true">assignment_late</span><div><p class="text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">Application status</p><h2 id="renter-applications-status-title" class="mt-1 text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Applications are not connected</h2><p class="mt-2 max-w-3xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">There is no Property, Application, submission, consent, delivery, viewing, decision, withdrawal, or status-history service.</p></div></div>
            <span class="inline-flex min-h-11 shrink-0 items-center rounded-full bg-surface-container-high px-4 text-label-sm font-bold text-on-surface-variant">0 application records</span>
          </div>
        </section>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-8 xl:grid-cols-12">
          <div class="space-y-8 xl:col-span-8">
            <section class="border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest px-6 py-10 text-center sm:px-8" aria-labelledby="renter-applications-empty-title"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-5xl text-primary" aria-hidden="true">inbox</span><p class="mt-4 text-label-sm font-bold uppercase text-secondary">0 application records</p><h2 id="renter-applications-empty-title" class="mt-2 text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">No applications to display</h2><p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-2xl text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">No draft, submitted, under-review, viewing, offered, accepted, declined, withdrawn, or expired application state is inferred.</p><a class="mt-6 inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-primary px-5 font-bold text-on-primary hover:opacity-90" href="/user/renter/dashboard"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl" aria-hidden="true">dashboard</span>Return to dashboard</a></section>

            <section aria-labelledby="application-foundations-title"><div class="mb-4"><h2 id="application-foundations-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Required application foundations</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Each submission must remain attributable, consented, recoverable, and fair.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2">
              <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">home_work</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Authoritative listing</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Start only from a published available listing with stable identity, landlord authorization, current terms, total costs, and application policy.</p></article>
              <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">approval</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Consented submission version</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Preview the exact profile fields and documents being shared, purpose, recipient, retention, expiry, withdrawal terms, and immutable version.</p></article>
              <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">outbox</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Reliable delivery lifecycle</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Use idempotent submission, landlord receipt, timestamps, retries, delivery failures, stage changes, viewing links, and renter-visible history.</p></article>
              <article class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-5"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary" aria-hidden="true">balance</span><h3 class="mt-3 font-bold text-on-surface">Fair review and decisions</h3><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">Require relevant consistent criteria, no protected-characteristic inference, explainable outcomes, correction, appeal where applicable, and withdrawal.</p></article>
            </div></section>

            <section aria-labelledby="application-stages-title"><div class="mb-4"><h2 id="application-stages-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface">Application stages</h2><p class="mt-1 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">All stages remain unavailable until an application service owns them.</p></div><dl class="divide-y divide-outline-variant rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest text-body-sm">
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Draft and submission preview</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Submitted and landlord receipt</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Review and information requests</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Viewing and decision</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
              <div class="flex flex-col gap-2 p-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"><dt class="font-bold text-on-surface">Withdrawal, expiry, and correction</dt><dd class="text-on-surface-variant">Unavailable</dd></div>
            </dl></section>
          </div>

          <aside class="space-y-6 xl:col-span-4" aria-label="Application boundaries">
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-outline-variant bg-surface-container-lowest p-6" aria-labelledby="application-actions-title"><h2 id="application-actions-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-primary">Action availability</h2><dl class="mt-4 divide-y divide-outline-variant text-body-sm"><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Start application</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Submit or update</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Book viewing</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div><div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4 py-3"><dt class="text-on-surface-variant">Withdraw application</dt><dd class="shrink-0 whitespace-nowrap font-bold text-on-surface">Unavailable</dd></div></dl></section>
            <section class="rounded-lg border border-error bg-error-container p-6" aria-labelledby="application-evidence-title"><h2 id="application-evidence-title" class="text-headline-md font-bold text-on-error-container">Do not send application evidence</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-error-container">Do not send identity files, income records, bank statements, references, contact details, access credentials, or complete applications through Contact or unverified messages.</p></section>
            <section class="border-l-4 border-primary bg-surface-container-low px-5 py-4" aria-labelledby="no-autopilot-title"><h2 id="no-autopilot-title" class="font-bold text-on-surface">No automated applications</h2><p class="mt-2 text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant">There is no paid Autopilot, background submission, match percentage, saved-property count, or automatic sharing. Every future submission requires an intentional preview and confirmation.</p></section>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
